   217→    case unignoreConfirmed
   218→    case processTapNotifications
   219→    case processTapRecipientProfile
   220→    case processToggleMuteNotifications
   221→    case displayAvatar(URL)
   222→    case processTapPolls
   223→    case toggleFavourite(isFavourite: Bool)
   224→    case processTapRolesAndPermissions
   225→    case processTapSecurityAndPrivacy
   226→    case processTapCall
